  "description": "Seeking a singletrack and bikepacking hardtail? Timberjack Eagle 70 Transmission is versatile enough to do both. Its aluminum frame is responsive and durable, designed with long, low, and slack geometry that grants confidence steep, techy terrain and preserves pedaling efficiency for riding to backcountry campsites.\n\nOur Alternator dropouts let you adapt to different hub standards and drivetrain setups (including single speed) by swapping dropout plates. Timberjack’s bottle and cargo mounts make it easy to stash all the supplies you need for a long day (or more) of trail riding — no hip pack needed.\n\nThe RockShox Psylo Silver RC fork delivers 140mm of trail-calming travel to help keep you in control on technical sections. SRAM’s Eagle 70 Transmission 12-speed groupset offers a wide gear range and trail-ready durability, while the four-piston DB4 brakes can haul you to a stop in a hurry. Whether you set up Timberjack to be your playful trail hardtail, comfortable bikepacking hardtail, or both, it’s up to the task.",
